course: dictionary
lesson: 493
title: Asian: a word for a place and its people
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Asian can be an adjective, which describes something, as in «Asian food» or «an Asian elephant». It means from Asia, the biggest continent, or connected with its people, countries, languages or food. Look at the word after it to see what it describes.
explain: Asian can also be a noun, meaning a person. An Asian is a person from Asia, or someone whose family comes from Asia. The plural is Asians. Always start it with a capital letter.
explain: Clues in the sentence help you. «Chopsticks are never stuck upright in rice, because in some Asian cultures that looks like a funeral custom.» Asian describes cultures, so it means cultures connected with Asia. Swap in your meaning: "in some cultures connected with Asia" still makes sense, so you are right.
explain: Asia covers a huge area with many countries. In the UK, Asian often means South Asian, such as people from India, Pakistan or Bangladesh. In the USA it often means East Asian. Read on and check which part of Asia is meant.
fact: Asia is the biggest continent in the world.
fact: Asian is an adjective (Asian food) and a noun (an Asian, Asians).
fact: Useful phrases: «Asian food», «Asian elephant», «South Asian», «East Asian».
fact: As the text says, an Asian elephant has one finger-like tip at the end of its trunk, while an African elephant has two.
fact: In geography, pupils learn about Asian rivers, mountains and animals.
exercise: «An Asian elephant often curls its trunk round things to pick them up.» What does Asian describe here? | An elephant from Africa with two finger-like tips | A toy elephant | An elephant that lives in the sea | *An elephant from Asia
exercise: Mia says, «Many Asians live in our city.» What is an Asian in this sentence? | A large mountain | A kind of food | *A person from Asia, or whose family comes from Asia | A country in Europe
exercise: Which phrase uses Asian as an adjective, describing something? | An Asian walked home | *Asian festival | Asians sang | Asia is a continent
test: «Ukraine is the largest country lying wholly in Europe, Russia being bigger only if you count its Asian land.» What does Asian land mean here? | Land in Europe | Land with no people | *Land that is part of Asia | Land covered in ice
test: Which is the biggest continent in the world? | Europe | America | Africa | *Asia
exam: Adam says, «I am an Asian, and my family comes from Asia.» What does an Asian mean in his sentence? | A country in Europe | A kind of Asian food | A type of elephant | *A person whose family comes from Asia
